{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1745340387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tring! is a score-attack game where you fly a triangle shaped spaceship and bounce your shot balls off walls. Every third bounce off your ball counts towards one point and destroying a golden square is another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/powerups.gif?t=1745340387\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every three levels you get a chance to select an upgrade. What will you choose? Speed, more bullets or one more turn to play?<br><br>Or catch a power-up and go into bullet time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/bullet_time_enter.gif?t=1745340387\" /><br><br>In bullet time time slows down and only moves when you move!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/extras/bullet_time_action.gif?t=1745340387\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680520?t=1745340387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680520?t=1745340387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/d14bf0c805cb328168d96c0eb867d95ca40553d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745340387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680520/d14bf0c805cb328168d96c0eb867d95ca40553d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745340387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen",